      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "22 February 2023, VRChat build 1282, this may have worked at one point but no longer works whatsoever. In attached images is MetallicGloss workflow textures, in Rero's Standard shader, modified to have the VRC docs' recommended \"VRCFallback\" tag included and set to equal \"Standard\"; the \"Toon\" fallback tag works but is not the goal here. Specular shaders are also still not falling back properties sporadically; I managed to get the _SpecGlossMap to show upon hiding shaders exactly once, but not upon showing and enforcing safety again (in a different session, forgot to get pictures then).",
